Package: plssemtools
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible PLS-SEM Analysis and Publication-Quality Figures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A reusable, dataset-agnostic workflow for Partial Least Squares
    Structural Equation Modeling (PLS-SEM) built on top of 'seminr'. Provides
    descriptive statistics, reliability and validity tables (Fornell-Larcker,
    HTMT, VIF, cross-loadings), bootstrapped significance testing, blindfolding-based
    Q-squared, and clean, journal-style ggplot2 figures (path diagrams, loading
    plots, importance-performance maps) suitable for direct inclusion in academic
    manuscripts. Designed to be pointed at any construct/item specification and
    any compatible survey dataset without modifying source code.
